 # 4\. Project Objectives

 ### Primary objectives

 1. Develop an easy-to-use AI comic creation platform.
2. Integrate Gemini models for story generation.
3. Automatically generate structured comic content.
4. Allow users to edit AI-generated content.
5. Maintain character and story consistency.
6. Provide individual AI regeneration tools.
7. Allow users to save and manage comic projects.
8. Provide a readable comic preview.
9. Support comic export.

 ### Secondary objectives

 - Reduce the barrier to comic creation.
- Help beginners learn storytelling.
- Encourage creative experimentation.
- Provide an extensible foundation for future image-generation capabilities.

