 # 16\. API Documentation

 ## Create Project

```
POST /api/comics
```

 Creates a new comic project.

---

 ## Get Projects

```
GET /api/comics
```

 Returns the authenticated user's projects.

---

 ## Get Comic

```
GET /api/comics/:id
```

 Returns a specific project.

---

 ## Generate Story

```
POST /api/ai/story
```

 Generates a complete initial comic structure.

---

 ## Generate Characters

```
POST /api/ai/characters
```

 Generates character profiles.

---

 ## Regenerate Panel

```
POST /api/ai/regenerate-panel
```

 Generates an alternative version of a selected panel.

---

 ## Rewrite Dialogue

```
POST /api/ai/rewrite-dialogue
```

 Creates alternative dialogue.

---

 ## Continue Story

```
POST /api/ai/continue-story
```

 Generates the next part of an existing comic.

