 # 19\. Error Handling Documentation

 The system should handle:

 ### AI failure

```
Unable to generate content.

[Try Again]
```

 ### Invalid AI response

```
The generated content could not be processed.

[Regenerate]
```

 ### Network error

```
Connection problem.

Your saved work is safe.
```

 ### Database error

```
We couldn't save your changes.

[Retry]
```

 The application should avoid losing existing user work when an AI operation fails.

